    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates for the first time, using an atmospheric chemistry transport model, that extreme forest fire events in Siberia can be a significant source of bioavailable iron to the western North Pacific Ocean, comparable to deposition from dust sources and impacting ocean fertilization.",
